.TH "spa-json-dump" 1 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
spa-json-dump \- SPA JSON to JSON converter

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-json\fP \fI[FILE]\fP

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
Reads a SPA JSON file or stdin, and outputs it as standard JSON\&.

.PP
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-json-dump\fP /usr/share/pipewire/pipewire\&.conf

.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire(1)\fP 

